WEBVTT

00:40.290 --> 00:45.003
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:09.444 --> 01:13.490
We have brought the liquor that's used
for Jinyowon's ancestral rites.

01:28.338 --> 01:30.381
The water used for the liquor changed.

01:31.341 --> 01:35.053
I mean, uh, well, you see,
due to the three-year drought,

01:35.136 --> 01:37.806
the well that we usually used
to make the ancestral rites liquor

01:37.889 --> 01:38.807
is all dried up.

01:47.899 --> 01:49.484
But what…

01:50.193 --> 01:51.319
Why did you…

01:52.195 --> 01:53.238
Go make them again.

01:54.697 --> 01:55.532
Huh?

01:56.032 --> 01:58.326
But how? But we have no water!

01:58.910 --> 02:01.162
How we… how are we
supposed to make any more?

02:01.246 --> 02:05.500
If you insist, could Jinyowon
allow us to use some of their water?

02:12.757 --> 02:14.592
Only let him in for the water.

02:14.676 --> 02:17.679
- Yes, my lady.
- Sir, but… Wait!

02:36.614 --> 02:38.658
The young lady's disappeared
from her room again.

02:38.741 --> 02:40.577
Stay right here and wait, you got it?

02:41.161 --> 02:42.412
Yes, of course.

02:51.129 --> 02:52.130
Beautiful!

03:42.388 --> 03:43.389
Is there liquor in there?

03:47.602 --> 03:48.603
Oh…

03:50.563 --> 03:51.397
Here.

04:03.910 --> 04:05.036
This is well made.

04:06.371 --> 04:07.205
Smells good!

04:08.414 --> 04:10.083
- Is there more?
- Uh…

04:10.959 --> 04:12.710
I have another bottle.

04:13.336 --> 04:14.545
Give it to me.

04:16.881 --> 04:19.300
Young lady! Young lady!

04:19.384 --> 04:21.636
- Search over there too.
- Hurry! Hurry, hurry, hurry!

04:21.719 --> 04:23.596
Uh-uh, here you go.

04:24.555 --> 04:25.556
Hold on! Wait!

04:33.648 --> 04:34.482
Shh!

04:45.868 --> 04:46.744
Wow!

04:48.454 --> 04:49.289
Beautiful!

04:55.086 --> 04:58.047
Never in my life have I ever seen
a more beautiful woman.

04:58.548 --> 05:00.049
Must have been a lady of Jinyowon.

05:00.133 --> 05:01.926
Jinyowon has one heir,

05:02.010 --> 05:04.053
and that's the Young Lady
Jin Cho-yeon we met earlier.

05:04.137 --> 05:05.346
This is Jinyowon, right?

05:06.431 --> 05:07.890
A relic's bewitched him.

05:08.641 --> 05:11.352
They've had their door closed
for three years, forbidding outsiders.

05:11.436 --> 05:12.937
There must be ghosts.

05:14.731 --> 05:16.524
Goodness!

05:16.607 --> 05:19.152
I don't care if she was
a ghost or not, I'd like to see her again.

05:19.235 --> 05:21.821
Oh, you little brat.
Don't go tempting misfortune

05:21.904 --> 05:24.198
especially while delivering
funeral drinks.

05:24.282 --> 05:26.117
- I'm sorry, sir.
- Before we go in,

05:26.743 --> 05:28.786
take one of these.
These charms can ward off ghosts.

05:28.870 --> 05:29.829
What's this?

05:30.538 --> 05:33.499
I heard these will ward off
soul shifters as well!

05:33.583 --> 05:35.877
You remember who devastated Songrim
three years ago?

05:35.960 --> 05:37.503
The one they called Naksu.

05:37.587 --> 05:42.050
Apparently, these charms were made
with the powder of her petrified body!

05:42.133 --> 05:43.468
- Really? From Naksu's body?
- Mm.

05:43.551 --> 05:45.178
- Whoa!
- No way!

05:45.762 --> 05:48.306
Naksu's body is at the bottom
of Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

05:48.389 --> 05:51.309
Come on. I can't believe
you fell for this nonsense.

05:51.392 --> 05:53.061
You wasted your money, really wasted…

05:53.144 --> 05:54.520
Oh, stop! it's…

05:56.064 --> 05:57.065
Hey, trust me!

05:57.148 --> 05:58.858
If you face a soul shifter,

05:58.941 --> 06:02.487
hold out this charm with Naksu's energy
and they go screaming like they--

06:08.117 --> 06:09.202
Did you just do that?

06:15.833 --> 06:18.294
I didn't!

06:18.378 --> 06:22.465
Wait for me!
Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no! No, no, no!

06:22.548 --> 06:24.717
Oh, no!

06:34.352 --> 06:37.355
Grab a weapon!

06:37.855 --> 06:40.233
What's that?

06:48.074 --> 06:49.659
Was this the work of a soul shifter?

06:52.703 --> 06:53.621
What's that?

07:17.603 --> 07:20.231
Is that… Is it a soul shifter?
Are we gonna die?

07:21.315 --> 07:22.191
Stay… stay back!

07:22.900 --> 07:24.986
- Oh, damn, you get back!
- Begone, demon!

07:25.069 --> 07:27.155
- Begone!
- Go now! Get away!

07:27.655 --> 07:28.906
Hold on!

07:30.575 --> 07:31.993
- He's not a soul shifter.
- He's not!

07:33.870 --> 07:34.704
What's that?

07:36.330 --> 07:37.206
Are they charms?

07:37.290 --> 07:39.208
They said they'd ward off soul shifters?

07:40.710 --> 07:42.128
Where'd you get them? Gaema Village?

07:43.504 --> 07:44.338
Uh-huh.

07:44.422 --> 07:46.757
- Hmm, how much did it cost?
- A silver nyang.

07:46.841 --> 07:48.468
- For all three?
- No, my lord.

07:48.551 --> 07:50.094
Three for all, one for each.

07:51.387 --> 07:52.680
Well, my lord.

07:53.598 --> 07:54.557
That's expensive.

07:55.725 --> 07:57.226
Gaema Village has no morals.

07:58.144 --> 07:59.979
I've heard other places sold
ten for one nyang.

08:00.062 --> 08:01.689
Really? Where though?

08:01.772 --> 08:03.649
Is that important right now, huh?

08:03.733 --> 08:04.984
Damn it!

08:05.067 --> 08:07.695
You should get your money's worth
since you've paid so much.

08:23.044 --> 08:24.128
If you want to live,

08:25.004 --> 08:26.547
you'd better get down right now.

10:05.187 --> 10:07.356
You have the ice stone,

10:07.440 --> 10:10.318
yet your Tansu can
only make a single drop?

10:11.319 --> 10:15.698
Since your soul returned to a dead body,
you, too, are a soul shifter.

10:16.866 --> 10:19.660
To everyone, we are both monsters.

10:21.704 --> 10:22.705
Are you finished yet?

10:24.582 --> 10:26.917
If not, hurry up because that one drop…

10:28.294 --> 10:29.420
is going to be very painful.

10:48.314 --> 10:51.359
How dare you lecture me when you stole
you son's body to live a little longer?

11:20.096 --> 11:23.974
So you're not a soul shifter,
but rather a mage who kills soul shifters.

11:25.601 --> 11:28.312
Thank you very much
for saving our lives, my lord.

11:29.313 --> 11:31.315
- Is that liquor hanging from your waist?
- Yeah.

11:31.399 --> 11:32.233
Hmm.

11:35.695 --> 11:36.529
Here.

11:44.078 --> 11:47.623
My goodness…
to have his body stolen by his father.

11:48.457 --> 11:49.458
That poor boy!

11:49.542 --> 11:52.545
So it's true soul shifters turn to stone
when they die.

11:54.463 --> 11:57.216
Ah, my lord,
then Naksu must have been petrified too?

11:58.259 --> 12:00.428
I was right! She was petrified.

12:01.387 --> 12:04.849
See, these charms really are made
from the powder of her petrified body!

12:07.226 --> 12:10.688
They say that this charm has the power
to ward off even monsters like her.

12:11.272 --> 12:12.273
Um, here, my lord.

12:12.857 --> 12:14.191
Would you like one?

12:29.415 --> 12:30.249
With this charm…

12:32.084 --> 12:33.544
even Naksu could be warded off?

12:37.506 --> 12:38.549
Do people really think…

12:40.009 --> 12:41.510
that it's even possible Naksu's alive?

12:42.386 --> 12:44.513
Naksu's dead, of course.

12:45.139 --> 12:47.308
Even though her body is
in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho,

12:47.808 --> 12:50.936
the people around here,
there's many that still fear her.

13:01.530 --> 13:04.325
Well, pretty soon, men from Songrim
will come to clean up here.

13:08.621 --> 13:10.080
Uh, my lord, tell us your name.

13:13.459 --> 13:15.127
I think I know who that mage is.

13:16.504 --> 13:18.130
He's known as the mage that had…

13:18.839 --> 13:20.591
managed to master Hwansu with…

13:22.301 --> 13:23.385
help from the ice stone.

13:23.469 --> 13:25.304
The one that Naksu almost killed?

13:26.764 --> 13:28.432
The master of the Jang family?

13:28.516 --> 13:32.394
But… what does he
have to do with that soul shifter, Naksu?

13:44.698 --> 13:47.117
This charm will
even ward off someone like Naksu.

13:49.078 --> 13:49.954
If I keep this,

13:52.289 --> 13:53.999
I couldn't see you
even if you ever returned.

14:39.879 --> 14:44.592
Naksu was his servant,
but also the love of his life

14:45.092 --> 14:46.427
who he intended to marry.

14:47.761 --> 14:50.097
And to return his affection for her,

14:51.849 --> 14:55.311
Naksu draw a sword
right through his chest.

15:43.192 --> 15:47.655
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

15:52.034 --> 15:53.577
The energy of the sky

15:53.661 --> 15:55.955
which reigns over the wind,
the rain, the clouds

15:56.038 --> 16:00.125
touched the land and created
a massive surge of energy,

16:00.209 --> 16:03.504
and with Lake Gyeongcheondaeho
keeping it contained at its center,

16:03.587 --> 16:04.922
a country was built.

16:05.798 --> 16:07.257
Because of the country's great lake,

16:08.300 --> 16:09.677
the nation was named Daeho.

16:10.844 --> 16:14.139
This tale is the story
about the mages of Daeho,

16:14.807 --> 16:17.393
a place that cannot be found
in history or with a map.

16:32.199 --> 16:34.326
- Enjoy.
- Say thank you, honey.

17:10.320 --> 17:11.864
That must be another soul shifter.

17:12.364 --> 17:13.574
I'm so scared.

17:26.003 --> 17:26.920
Did you lose her?

17:27.546 --> 17:30.799
She fled into… Jinyowon just a moment ago.

17:35.054 --> 17:35.888
Jinyowon?

17:41.143 --> 17:42.603
JINYOWON

17:42.686 --> 17:45.773
Outsiders are forbidden
from stepping foot into Jinyowon.

17:45.856 --> 17:48.734
Jinyowon, for the past three years,
has kept its door barred,

17:48.817 --> 17:50.986
forbidding any outsiders
from entering, I get it.

17:51.070 --> 17:53.739
However, a soul shifter ran inside
and it's urgent.

17:54.531 --> 17:56.200
Tell Lady Jin
I want to speak directly with her.

17:56.283 --> 17:58.702
Lady Jin has no interest
in meeting with you.

17:58.786 --> 18:00.454
This man is the leader of Songrim.

18:00.537 --> 18:03.040
How dare a lowly
and ordinary priestess like yourself

18:03.123 --> 18:05.501
refuse to relay his lord's dire message?

18:05.584 --> 18:07.669
- My apologies.
- Open the gate right now!

18:40.953 --> 18:42.079
Young Lady Cho-yeon.

18:44.373 --> 18:46.333
It's been three years already.

18:47.376 --> 18:49.128
How have you been
holding up all this time?

18:49.211 --> 18:51.380
I did not come out here
to exchange pleasantries.

18:52.131 --> 18:55.592
My mother maintains
that she won't let outsiders in.

18:57.719 --> 18:58.804
So please, just go now.

18:59.596 --> 19:01.056
But the situation's dire.

19:01.640 --> 19:04.226
This soul shifter has already
harmed dozens at Yeongpo Dock.

19:04.309 --> 19:06.186
The people of Jinyowon might
get hurt as well.

19:06.270 --> 19:07.688
Like my father did?

19:10.107 --> 19:13.110
You couldn't even save
the father of your betrothed.

19:14.528 --> 19:16.321
How could you save anyone?

19:20.576 --> 19:21.577
Afterwards…

19:24.454 --> 19:26.790
you never gave me
the chance to say how sorry I was.

19:27.916 --> 19:29.459
It… It's always weighed on my heart.

19:29.543 --> 19:30.752
May that continue.

19:32.171 --> 19:33.672
I hope that you'll never forget.

19:34.840 --> 19:36.258
Y-Young Lady Jin--

19:36.341 --> 19:37.551
Please just go now.

20:20.469 --> 20:21.303
Dang-gu…

20:22.638 --> 20:24.348
did someone just enter?

20:26.141 --> 20:27.392
Oh, yes.

20:28.644 --> 20:30.229
I believe that was Jang Uk, actually.

20:32.022 --> 20:34.399
He was out here chasing
that soul shifter with us.

20:35.275 --> 20:36.318
Jang Uk is here?

20:37.819 --> 20:40.030
You mean that he just let himself in?

20:40.822 --> 20:41.657
Because Uk's…

20:42.407 --> 20:45.035
on the order of the royal family
and the Unanimous Assembly.

20:47.329 --> 20:48.538
I'm closing the gate.

20:50.457 --> 20:51.291
Please just go.

21:05.347 --> 21:07.140
He will undoubtedly
catch the soul shifter,

21:07.224 --> 21:08.433
now that he's managed to get inside.

21:08.517 --> 21:10.269
I believe we can just wait
for him out here, my lord.

21:12.104 --> 21:12.938
Fine.

21:22.948 --> 21:25.742
You're telling me
Jang Uk has entered Jinyowon?

21:25.826 --> 21:26.660
Right.

21:27.244 --> 21:29.454
He's chasing a soul shifter
that's hiding here.

21:30.163 --> 21:33.083
And Bu-yeon, is she still
in the annex like she was told?

21:33.166 --> 21:35.085
The room that Bu-yeon is confined in

21:35.919 --> 21:37.963
is hidden by a barrier,
so it won't be seen.

21:39.214 --> 21:41.717
I promise he'll never find her.

22:33.310 --> 22:34.895
Looks like you shifted a while ago.

22:44.696 --> 22:45.530
What's this?

23:26.863 --> 23:27.864
What is this place?

23:29.991 --> 23:30.826
A prison?

24:01.773 --> 24:02.816
Don't touch that.

24:09.322 --> 24:11.575
Who are you? How'd you get in here?

24:24.421 --> 24:25.255
Are you crazy?

24:25.338 --> 24:27.382
You look like
every other lousy Jinyowon priestess.

24:27.466 --> 24:28.884
How dare you point a poker at me?

24:31.136 --> 24:32.345
That's incredible.

24:34.222 --> 24:36.975
Did you get in here
by breaking through the barrier outside?

24:37.058 --> 24:39.269
Any Jinyowon priestess would
recognize who I am.

24:40.103 --> 24:41.188
Who are you?

24:41.771 --> 24:43.106
What is this place?

24:44.107 --> 24:45.108
Is this a prison?

24:45.734 --> 24:47.736
You're… locked in here?

24:49.321 --> 24:50.780
It's not a prison.

24:56.036 --> 24:57.537
I can probably use this to get out.

25:02.792 --> 25:04.753
Throw this as well, go on now.

25:05.504 --> 25:06.338
What?

25:07.797 --> 25:09.049
Is it too flat to work?

25:10.759 --> 25:11.760
Then…

25:18.141 --> 25:20.227
Is this one better? Uh…

25:24.272 --> 25:25.732
This one, or maybe this one?

25:29.778 --> 25:31.279
So you really are locked up in here.

25:31.363 --> 25:32.405
Don't know…

25:33.657 --> 25:34.991
You must be really ill.

25:35.992 --> 25:37.118
Could this work?

25:37.786 --> 25:38.703
Wait, you're leaving?

25:39.371 --> 25:41.873
Fine then, take me too, all right?

25:49.756 --> 25:50.757
Are you…

25:51.758 --> 25:52.968
going to try and follow me out?

25:53.677 --> 25:55.428
It's been forever since I was out.

26:01.393 --> 26:02.936
I can smell flowers on your clothes.

26:03.645 --> 26:05.313
The roses must be in bloom then, right?

26:07.315 --> 26:08.149
Look here.

26:08.942 --> 26:11.528
I understand that you're truly
dying to get out of this place,

26:12.779 --> 26:13.822
but I can't help you.

26:13.905 --> 26:16.449
But that probably can, use that instead.

26:16.533 --> 26:18.535
No, not that, too exhausting.

26:18.618 --> 26:20.787
- Take me with!
- Look, you lousy priestess.

26:22.622 --> 26:25.709
Unless you want to end up like the poker
in the wall, get off of me immediately.

26:28.295 --> 26:29.421
I'm not used to people…

26:30.672 --> 26:32.173
standing this close to me anymore.

26:46.688 --> 26:47.981
That's a pretty stone you have.

26:51.693 --> 26:52.527
So…

26:53.528 --> 26:55.071
you have the sky's energy, don't you?

26:57.282 --> 26:59.075
I guess you're not as lousy as I thought.

26:59.159 --> 26:59.993
You…

27:00.744 --> 27:02.162
can see what's inside me?

27:03.079 --> 27:03.913
Yeah.

27:04.539 --> 27:06.249
I have the ability to see all the energy.

27:07.250 --> 27:09.669
I heard some rumors about
a priestess who can see energy.

27:10.503 --> 27:11.504
Are you saying that's you?

27:13.089 --> 27:15.425
Then who are you, huh?

27:16.301 --> 27:18.928
There's a good reason why
I can't reveal who I am just yet.

27:20.221 --> 27:21.473
But once you find out,

27:21.556 --> 27:24.643
I can promise you that you'll definitely
want to help me out of here.

27:31.274 --> 27:32.108
Jang Uk?

27:32.192 --> 27:34.527
There are signs of his fight
with the soul shifter everywhere.

27:34.611 --> 27:35.945
Even where Bu-yeon is hiding?

27:36.029 --> 27:38.740
I don't know. I couldn't search it
because of the barrier.

27:38.823 --> 27:41.576
Oh, dear! That area is vulnerable.

27:41.660 --> 27:44.621
We can't let Jang Uk see her,
no matter what.

27:49.417 --> 27:52.212
Seeing as how they went
as far as surrounding you with a barrier,

27:52.295 --> 27:54.047
I suppose they didn't put you
in here because you're crazy.

27:54.130 --> 27:57.217
If you get me out,
I'll actually tell you who I really am.

27:57.801 --> 27:59.302
You'll be shocked when you know.

28:02.138 --> 28:04.224
- No deal.
- You're not curious about who I am?

28:04.307 --> 28:07.018
At the moment, Jinyowon and I are not
on the best of terms with each other.

28:07.102 --> 28:10.313
Letting you out could possibly worsen
my relationship with them even further.

28:11.022 --> 28:13.233
You and Jinyowon have bad blood?

28:23.243 --> 28:24.911
This here was your escape, right?

28:27.122 --> 28:28.415
Not very good.

28:28.498 --> 28:30.208
Hey, that took me
three whole days to make!

28:33.378 --> 28:34.212
Three days, huh?

28:38.091 --> 28:39.676
Hey!

28:44.639 --> 28:45.932
You could have left without me.

28:46.015 --> 28:47.434
Why did you have to do that?

28:47.517 --> 28:50.019
Because they will suspect me
if you escape right after I left.

28:50.103 --> 28:51.771
I don't want any misunderstandings.

28:52.605 --> 28:54.816
This took you three days,
then postpone your escape

28:54.899 --> 28:56.651
by three more days
so I'm not linked to it.

29:02.574 --> 29:04.451
I just wanted to leave for a little while.

29:05.660 --> 29:08.580
Even if I did get out, I…

29:10.039 --> 29:11.416
would have to return anyway.

29:19.632 --> 29:21.885
So why's a priestess like you
locked up in here in the first place?

29:23.261 --> 29:24.304
What are you guilty of?

29:26.139 --> 29:27.182
The crime of living.

29:28.683 --> 29:30.143
I'm guilty of being born.

29:32.145 --> 29:33.688
The crime that has locked me up

29:34.689 --> 29:36.649
is my existence in this world at all.

29:39.694 --> 29:41.571
I had died a very long time ago.

29:47.577 --> 29:48.620
This must have been Jang Uk.

29:49.829 --> 29:52.665
He must have fought
all the way to the annex's entrance.

30:09.057 --> 30:09.891
Bu-yeon.

30:14.103 --> 30:14.938
Bu-yeon.

30:15.563 --> 30:17.524
Did you see anyone come in?

30:17.607 --> 30:18.691
No.

30:19.776 --> 30:22.195
Who else would have come in here
other than Mother and you?

30:27.367 --> 30:28.201
Why?

30:29.077 --> 30:30.161
Did something happen?

30:31.454 --> 30:33.122
A soul shifter snuck in here.

30:34.207 --> 30:36.251
And a mage entered when he chased her

30:36.960 --> 30:38.336
causing a commotion.

30:38.419 --> 30:39.546
Soul shifter?

30:40.588 --> 30:42.841
A monster whose soul
doesn't belong to its body?

30:44.217 --> 30:45.051
Uh.

30:46.135 --> 30:48.471
But we killed it, so don't worry.

31:02.527 --> 31:05.947
So he was a mage
who came to kill a soul shifter.

31:12.662 --> 31:15.290
This will be more than enough
for you to make your escape.

31:19.294 --> 31:20.628
Let me be very clear.

31:20.712 --> 31:23.673
They can't know I was here,
so wait a while after I go.

31:24.757 --> 31:25.842
Sure!

31:28.177 --> 31:29.429
Go put up two more.

31:30.096 --> 31:32.765
I'm not nearly… as tall as you.

31:32.849 --> 31:33.975
Will two more be enough?

31:34.809 --> 31:36.728
- You are really short.
- So three more then!

31:38.521 --> 31:39.606
Thanks.

31:43.776 --> 31:46.779
Oh, and why did you decide to help me?

31:47.488 --> 31:48.948
What's with the change of heart, huh?

31:50.074 --> 31:51.576
Because we're guilty of the same crime.

31:54.078 --> 31:55.622
The crime of being here, existing…

31:56.998 --> 31:57.916
when I should not be.

32:12.555 --> 32:14.390
Someone guilty of the same crime…

32:33.743 --> 32:35.954
The roses outside must have
really bloomed now.

32:56.975 --> 32:59.352
SONGRIM

33:02.480 --> 33:05.483
This soul shifter got on
a cargo ship at Yeongpo Dock

33:05.566 --> 33:07.193
and slaughtered everyone onboard the ship.

33:07.735 --> 33:10.863
Soul shifters that have run wild
are showing up everywhere.

33:11.364 --> 33:12.198
Hmm.

33:12.281 --> 33:14.701
Uk's been the one who's been killing them.

33:14.784 --> 33:19.497
That's only because we all agreed
that's how we use him since he was reborn…

33:20.581 --> 33:22.458
…with the power
of the ice stone within him.

33:22.542 --> 33:23.626
Because you "agreed"?

33:24.794 --> 33:26.504
Uk's just doing what you told him to.

33:27.714 --> 33:28.548
Are you…

33:30.091 --> 33:32.301
still feeling awkward
when you're around Jang Uk?

33:33.636 --> 33:36.347
Since Yul has returned
to live in Seoho Fortress.

33:36.431 --> 33:38.349
You're the only friend he has.

33:38.433 --> 33:41.352
If you distance yourself,
what does he have left?

33:42.937 --> 33:44.439
I'm not trying to be distant.

33:45.106 --> 33:45.940
It's just…

33:47.692 --> 33:49.610
I don't know how to act around him.

33:51.487 --> 33:54.699
It's not like I can say
I'm envious of the power he holds.

33:56.200 --> 33:58.119
But I can't try to comfort him,

33:59.454 --> 34:00.580
and say it's okay to give up.

34:02.707 --> 34:04.417
Nothing's like how it used to be.

34:04.500 --> 34:06.502
Well, since he used the ice stone,

34:07.295 --> 34:09.380
to vanquish the soul shifter,

34:10.006 --> 34:13.301
I assume he'll have trouble
sleeping tonight as well.

34:13.384 --> 34:14.886
Oh, dear me.

34:23.227 --> 34:24.937
We received words from Songrim.

34:25.813 --> 34:28.357
Are you doing all right?

34:29.692 --> 34:31.152
When am I ever not all right?

34:32.070 --> 34:34.572
Worrying about me all the time
is gonna kill you, Maidservant Kim.

34:35.073 --> 34:36.365
So don't worry about me.

34:40.912 --> 34:42.413
If you had to use that sword,

34:43.372 --> 34:44.957
I suppose that you'll struggle tonight.

34:45.041 --> 34:46.667
I'm pretty used to it now.

34:47.752 --> 34:48.961
It happens to me every time.

34:58.596 --> 34:59.847
Did you heat up his room today?

35:00.890 --> 35:03.518
Prepare a strong drink,
and make sure he has a brazier.

35:05.061 --> 35:07.188
I'm too scared
to enter his room on my own.

35:08.189 --> 35:10.483
Going near the Young Master's room
gives me goosebumps all over.

35:10.566 --> 35:12.735
- Sends chills down my spine.
- Goodness.

35:13.236 --> 35:15.863
Just light it, okay? I'll carry it inside.

35:15.947 --> 35:16.781
Yes.

35:44.225 --> 35:47.145
- Save me!
- Help! Please help me!

35:47.979 --> 35:51.315
I don't want to die.

35:52.233 --> 35:53.734
I want the ice stone!

36:00.449 --> 36:03.286
Since he is a human
using the energy of the sky,

36:03.369 --> 36:06.622
wraiths would surround him
to feed on that power.

36:07.165 --> 36:11.210
They are deafening, cold,
unsightly, and pitiful.

36:12.003 --> 36:14.881
That's the price one pays
for taking the ice stone

36:14.964 --> 36:17.258
and using the energy of the sky.

36:34.317 --> 36:36.694
Yeongpo Dock lost many workers
to the soul shifter,

36:36.777 --> 36:38.154
it will be closed for a while.

36:38.237 --> 36:40.907
We need to deliver these goods
to Wol Fortress by land.

36:41.616 --> 36:43.367
The road to Daegangtongun will be fastest.

36:43.451 --> 36:44.410
Yes, my lord.

36:49.165 --> 36:53.961
Young Master Park is really starting to
look like the leader of Songrim now.

36:54.045 --> 36:56.380
He hasn't shown much promise
when it comes to spells casting,

36:56.464 --> 37:00.051
but as a businessman, he has been…
exceptionally outstanding.

37:03.638 --> 37:05.264
- Young Lady Heo.
- Hmm?

37:18.236 --> 37:21.697
Has Young Lady Heo decided not
to return to Wol Fortress after all?

37:21.781 --> 37:25.618
She's been in charge of tending
to the new body of the Queen now.

37:26.285 --> 37:27.119
So she can't leave.

37:27.203 --> 37:30.248
But you said she visited
your home a few days ago?

37:30.957 --> 37:31.916
Yes, my lord.

37:32.625 --> 37:35.253
She said she was worried
about our young master's insomnia,

37:35.836 --> 37:38.506
so she insisted of
bringing the medicine herself.

37:38.589 --> 37:43.094
So then has he… has he ever thanked her,
like, asked her to get tea with him?

37:45.137 --> 37:48.224
I understand her,
so I've tried my best to help.

37:49.016 --> 37:50.101
But it's not easy with him.

37:52.103 --> 37:55.273
I keep saying
she should give up on him already,

37:55.356 --> 37:56.899
but she won't listen.

37:56.983 --> 37:58.526
I'll keep trying.

37:58.609 --> 38:02.113
So you're going to visit Jin, yeah?

38:02.196 --> 38:03.572
- Right.
- If you go,

38:03.656 --> 38:06.575
you know that…
that silly new hobby of his, this one.

38:07.243 --> 38:08.995
Could you try to persuade him to quit?

38:09.870 --> 38:10.871
It's all thanks to him

38:10.955 --> 38:13.708
that almost every person
in Songrim have pickled tongues.

38:14.292 --> 38:16.836
- They all have pickled tongues?
- Our tongues are a mess.

38:16.919 --> 38:18.921
What could he do to make people suffer?

39:08.637 --> 39:09.722
Hello, my lord.

39:10.765 --> 39:13.267
- What are you up to?
- It's nice to see you.

39:13.893 --> 39:15.978
Today, I'm making kkakdugi,
Maidservant Kim.

39:16.062 --> 39:18.272
Are you really using all of this?

39:18.356 --> 39:21.484
You should see how delighted
everyone looks whenever I bring

39:21.567 --> 39:24.070
a new batch of kimchi
I made into the kitchen.

39:24.153 --> 39:25.029
Yeah.

39:25.738 --> 39:27.865
I heard you gave them five massive pots

39:27.948 --> 39:30.326
of mustard leaf
and green onion kimchi last time.

39:30.409 --> 39:32.328
Well, there's really not that much to it.

39:32.411 --> 39:34.372
I really only do it
to help the time go by.

39:35.539 --> 39:38.626
That said everyone's so eager
for my kimchi now.

39:39.627 --> 39:42.129
I don't think
they are that desperate for kimchi.

39:43.047 --> 39:44.924
You don't need to make this much.

39:45.007 --> 39:48.302
I know they can't just ask me for more
since I can be pretty intimidating.

39:49.637 --> 39:51.180
Even I say that, you know.

39:51.263 --> 39:53.015
I ought to make more.

39:53.099 --> 39:54.934
I need to get way more garlic then.

39:55.726 --> 39:56.727
I'll be back soon.

40:01.690 --> 40:03.526
Everyone's begging me to stop him.

40:20.459 --> 40:23.170
I can now see why
Maidservant Park was going insane.

40:23.254 --> 40:25.506
Ugh! If he makes a lot of this here,

40:26.340 --> 40:29.051
we will never get rid of it.
Eating this is practically torture!

40:37.518 --> 40:38.352
Oh, yes.

40:39.145 --> 40:42.731
Uh, my lord, I could
really use some radish now.

40:42.815 --> 40:44.608
Could I please take
some of those there with me?

40:44.692 --> 40:45.609
Of course.

40:45.693 --> 40:48.362
But then, I won't have enough
for kkakdugi.

40:48.446 --> 40:50.489
Oh, I think this is a lot.

40:51.240 --> 40:53.117
Too much of anything is never good.

40:54.034 --> 40:55.119
Yes, that is very true.

40:56.745 --> 40:58.664
- Please sit down.
- Sure.

41:06.839 --> 41:10.759
Do you feel like there's a hole in you
ever since you stepped down?

41:12.219 --> 41:14.638
I tend my land now, care for the flowers

41:14.722 --> 41:16.182
and do my own housework.

41:16.265 --> 41:17.349
I like it for what it is.

41:19.310 --> 41:20.144
Right.

41:30.029 --> 41:33.324
You've planted so many balsam seeds.

41:37.703 --> 41:41.123
My Young Master
still seems to be recovering.

41:44.793 --> 41:45.920
I'm afraid…

41:47.004 --> 41:49.173
I'll have to stay by his side this year.

41:51.884 --> 41:52.801
Yes, I know.

41:53.594 --> 41:55.221
Three years ago when everything happened,

41:56.013 --> 41:58.807
you take it upon yourself
to step down and take the blame.

42:00.684 --> 42:03.145
I should have discouraged you.
But instead, I…

42:04.063 --> 42:05.147
brazenly thanked you for it,

42:07.107 --> 42:10.194
because I was relieved
they spared my young master.

42:11.779 --> 42:12.905
All thanks to you!

42:15.991 --> 42:18.911
We haven't even started peeling
the garlic and yet you're crying now.

42:21.956 --> 42:24.333
We have all of these yet to peel.

42:25.501 --> 42:26.335
Yeah.

42:26.919 --> 42:28.963
I'll peel all the garlic for you, my lord.

42:30.798 --> 42:33.342
But it'll be too bitter
if you put all this in there.

42:33.425 --> 42:35.636
Everything tastes better
the more you put in, you know.

42:38.973 --> 42:42.393
I forgot I need some garlic,
so please let me take at least half.

42:44.353 --> 42:46.105
Will it be as tasty then?

42:46.188 --> 42:48.732
Half of that is more than plenty.

42:52.570 --> 42:54.780
What do you mean
Jinyowon's preparing for a wedding?

42:54.863 --> 42:57.408
Do you remember how we placed
all of those gifts into storage?

42:57.491 --> 42:59.702
Everything we're supposed
to use for your wedding to Lady Jin.

43:00.744 --> 43:03.497
Today, they requested for us
to send all of them over to Jinyowon.

43:06.584 --> 43:10.045
I believe someone's getting married.

43:10.129 --> 43:12.923
But the only one in the Jin family

43:13.632 --> 43:15.384
who could get married
is Young Lady Cho-yeon.

43:26.312 --> 43:28.188
The wedding date has already been set?

43:28.939 --> 43:30.566
Mother, that feels a bit rushed.

43:31.859 --> 43:33.485
The suitor wasn't easy
to find.

43:33.569 --> 43:35.779
My decision will be final.

43:37.865 --> 43:38.782
How could…

43:39.867 --> 43:41.243
That's cruel, Mother!

43:44.038 --> 43:45.247
She actually…

43:46.749 --> 43:48.083
not my real sister,

43:49.585 --> 43:51.545
- but that other woman?
- Jin Cho-yeon.

43:55.215 --> 43:56.050
She is Bu-yeon.

43:57.092 --> 43:58.510
That woman's soul was gone

43:58.594 --> 44:01.513
by the time we retrieved Bu-yeon's body
from the lake three years ago.

44:02.181 --> 44:05.684
That body belongs to my daughter, Bu-yeon.

44:26.705 --> 44:27.831
Bu-yeon, dear.

44:30.793 --> 44:32.252
Yes, Mother.

44:35.631 --> 44:38.175
I am going to get married soon?

44:39.760 --> 44:42.930
If I marry, does it mean that
I can leave this room then?

44:43.013 --> 44:44.306
He'll come and live with you here.

44:44.390 --> 44:46.308
When he arrives on your wedding day,

44:46.392 --> 44:51.146
you will continue living in this room,
just as you always have been.

44:52.690 --> 44:56.777
If I'm still going to remain locked up,
then why do I have to get married now?

44:56.860 --> 44:59.780
Because we need an heir
who will lead Jinyowon.

45:00.447 --> 45:03.367
The children that yield
the greatest divine powers have…

45:04.368 --> 45:05.994
always come from the eldest daughters.

45:07.913 --> 45:11.083
Please gift us all
a daughter with your powers.

45:14.086 --> 45:17.881
You're saying I'm forced
to be here so I can give birth to a child?

45:20.884 --> 45:21.927
No, I don't want to.

45:22.594 --> 45:24.096
That's not the marriage I want to have.

45:24.680 --> 45:26.306
It has already been decided.

45:26.390 --> 45:27.808
Just do what you're told.

45:30.394 --> 45:32.688
But if I get married
like you want me to, Mother,

45:33.814 --> 45:36.108
that means I have to
live my life inside this room.

45:38.652 --> 45:39.486
Bu-yeon, dear.

45:40.237 --> 45:42.865
After I lost you, it took years
for me to find you again.

45:45.033 --> 45:49.872
Get married to the man that I have chosen,
then you can stay by my side forever.

45:53.167 --> 45:54.001
Mother.

45:55.919 --> 45:57.504
Who is the man that Bu-yeon…

45:58.672 --> 45:59.506
is marrying?

45:59.590 --> 46:01.925
He comes from the Seo family
at Seoho Fortress.

46:02.009 --> 46:04.428
When he arrives, he'll stay at Chwiseonru.

46:04.511 --> 46:07.556
And then the wedding will take place
at his uncle's house.

46:08.766 --> 46:12.436
He's the suitor that's perfect
in every possible way.

46:43.801 --> 46:45.677
It looks like we'll arrive at Daeho soon.

46:46.261 --> 46:47.596
You haven't been for three years?

46:47.679 --> 46:48.514
Yeah.

46:49.723 --> 46:52.976
I didn't know it'd be three years
before I'd be able to come back here.

46:53.936 --> 46:54.770
But Yul,

46:55.395 --> 46:59.733
why did Master Heo forbid you from
returning to Daeho for such a long time?

46:59.817 --> 47:01.693
You're not the kind
that gets into trouble.

47:02.277 --> 47:04.446
Did you have a problem
with someone in Songrim?

47:05.697 --> 47:06.990
Master Heo did it to protect me.

47:08.408 --> 47:11.203
Because I was a coward,
I just did as I was told.

47:15.332 --> 47:17.459
The water level
of the lake's dropped considerably.

47:17.543 --> 47:19.044
I guess due to the three-year drought.

47:19.628 --> 47:20.629
Its energy is weaker too.

47:20.712 --> 47:23.549
There's even talk about
performing some rites for the lake.

47:24.341 --> 47:26.510
The Unanimous Assembly plans to meet.

47:26.593 --> 47:27.761
And if they perform that rite,

47:28.512 --> 47:31.974
the Jinyowon priestess will be
something they're all desperate for.

47:38.605 --> 47:40.107
Jang Uk of Songrim

47:40.190 --> 47:43.443
has defeated his 29th soul shifter
and have retrieved their soul.

47:43.527 --> 47:44.820
So then as usual,

47:46.113 --> 47:49.658
the Crown Prince shall personally
visit him to give him his reward.

47:51.660 --> 47:53.120
Sire, from this moment on,

47:53.787 --> 47:56.540
Cheonbugwan will deliver them
instead of the prince.

47:56.623 --> 47:57.916
No, Sire.

47:58.000 --> 48:02.337
I must insist that the Crown Prince
go and reward Uk himself as always.

48:14.850 --> 48:16.852
Since every kill is 1,000 gold nyang,

48:17.477 --> 48:20.022
Jang Uk is well on his way to
becoming the wealthiest man in Daeho.

48:20.105 --> 48:23.066
If 1,000 gold nyang is
all it costs for the credit,

48:23.150 --> 48:24.568
then you should happily pay it.

48:25.152 --> 48:28.071
The people of Daeho believe that
you were the one who ordered Jang Uk

48:28.155 --> 48:30.115
to kill all of the monsters
that have run wild.

48:30.198 --> 48:33.535
They even praise you
for being the King's Star.

48:34.328 --> 48:35.746
All the while,

48:35.829 --> 48:38.081
they call him a monster
who catches other monsters.

48:38.165 --> 48:40.292
Everyone fears him and avoids him.

48:40.375 --> 48:42.002
That's something
that Jang Uk brought upon himself.

48:42.920 --> 48:46.006
Why does he insist on carrying
Naksu's sword when that's what killed him?

48:46.089 --> 48:48.133
Some say it's because
he bears a bitter grudge,

48:48.216 --> 48:51.261
while there are others who say
he's still painfully in love with her.

48:54.681 --> 48:56.850
What are your thought on this,
Your Royal Highness?

48:56.934 --> 48:58.185
He's nothing but a lunatic.

48:58.268 --> 48:59.978
A dark and ominous figure

49:00.062 --> 49:02.314
who's chosen to wield her sword
and kill soul shifters,

49:02.397 --> 49:03.690
who are just like she was.

49:05.943 --> 49:08.779
That's exactly how people perceive him.
That's what he is now.

49:08.862 --> 49:11.490
Is that not how you intended it
to be, Your Royal Highness?

49:19.748 --> 49:21.833
He's living the life
you wanted him to have.

49:22.334 --> 49:23.251
Go to him, Sire.

49:23.835 --> 49:27.839
So you can personally praise and reward
that dark and ominous lunatic yourself.

49:51.697 --> 49:53.657
When I visit this empty Jeongjingak,

49:53.740 --> 49:55.367
my heart feels very heavy.

49:55.450 --> 49:58.787
Since Jang Uk is the last mage
that remains in these halls,

49:58.870 --> 50:01.248
the energy you feel in this place
is entirely his.

50:01.331 --> 50:03.834
They say wherever he goes,
it's always cold and dark.

50:13.593 --> 50:16.221
I've come here to reward you
for the soul shifters you've killed.

50:17.055 --> 50:18.306
Thanks as always, Your Highness.

50:19.057 --> 50:20.183
You can just leave it and go.

50:25.856 --> 50:28.233
How dare he tell you to leave
instead of accepting it himself?

50:28.984 --> 50:30.360
Should I go and demand that he return?

50:30.444 --> 50:31.278
It's fine.

50:41.872 --> 50:44.708
I heard that you followed the soul shifter
all the way into Jinyowon.

50:45.792 --> 50:48.462
Haven't they forbidden outsiders
from entering? How'd you get in?

50:48.545 --> 50:50.464
Do you really think
there's anywhere I can't enter

50:50.547 --> 50:52.049
just because someone said no?

50:52.132 --> 50:54.634
I'm very used to feeling
not being welcomed.

50:57.721 --> 51:00.348
Is that why you drink alone
in this dark and gloomy place?

51:04.728 --> 51:06.813
Park Dang-gu used to be
pretty good friends with you.

51:06.897 --> 51:07.939
Now though…

51:08.774 --> 51:10.275
it might be a bit harder to laugh with him

51:10.358 --> 51:11.985
when you're the reason
his wedding fell through.

51:12.694 --> 51:14.988
Seo Yul ran off
to live in the Seoho Fortress.

51:15.072 --> 51:17.949
And apparently, all the mages
in Jeongjingak left because of you.

51:21.036 --> 51:22.746
You really are alone, aren't you?

51:31.838 --> 51:34.508
I'm not going to sugarcoat my words
and try and protect your feelings, okay?

51:38.261 --> 51:40.764
Hey, why… why do you drink
such strong liquor?

51:40.847 --> 51:42.265
My insides feel like they're burning.

51:42.349 --> 51:44.184
Force it down. It's better if it's strong.

51:44.810 --> 51:47.854
Strong liquor is gonna be good against
the chill the wraiths emit.

51:47.938 --> 51:48.855
Wait! Wraiths?

51:51.566 --> 51:52.692
But this is Jeongjingak.

51:53.985 --> 51:54.986
Oh, you didn't hear?

51:55.070 --> 51:56.738
How those things follow me everywhere.

52:01.952 --> 52:02.786
What?

52:03.453 --> 52:04.788
It's the middle of the day though.

52:07.124 --> 52:07.958
That's just absurd.

52:08.041 --> 52:10.418
You're welcome to leave
if you feel uncomfortable being here.

52:10.502 --> 52:12.504
I highly doubt you came here today
because you missed me.

52:12.587 --> 52:14.756
Then why do you every time
ask me to reward you in person

52:14.840 --> 52:16.508
if you know how uncomfortable
it makes me feel?

52:17.008 --> 52:18.260
I really doubt you need the money.

52:19.553 --> 52:20.804
It makes me feel at ease.

52:20.887 --> 52:22.430
My heart feels much lighter

52:22.514 --> 52:25.392
knowing that my power can only be used
for atoning sins and being rewarded.

52:25.475 --> 52:28.728
So all of the praises I've been receiving
from punishing and rewarding you

52:30.147 --> 52:31.690
must appear also trifling to you, right?

52:36.528 --> 52:38.029
This is what I hate about you, Jang Uk.

52:38.113 --> 52:41.158
The way you look down and mock
everything that I care about.

52:41.241 --> 52:42.450
I find it very offensive.

52:42.534 --> 52:44.411
Don't you think
you should be offended, Your Highness?

52:45.704 --> 52:47.581
That's why I'm doing this
without any question.

52:53.461 --> 52:55.255
You're afraid to dismiss me as arrogant.

52:55.839 --> 52:58.758
And yet you're too proud to admit
that I'm filled with spirit.

52:59.885 --> 53:01.469
I'm sure you can't stand that.

53:07.893 --> 53:08.852
You're right.

53:10.478 --> 53:13.023
You are just as annoying
as a splinter under my fingernail.

53:13.106 --> 53:14.900
A splinter under my fingernail, huh?

53:16.610 --> 53:17.861
How trifling.

53:20.697 --> 53:21.823
Did Jin Mu say…

53:22.908 --> 53:24.910
you should just dismiss me
so that you feel better?

53:30.415 --> 53:31.583
Am I not too…

53:33.293 --> 53:34.836
powerful to be a splinter to you?

53:39.090 --> 53:41.301
I get you're frustrated
because you can't just rip me out,

53:41.384 --> 53:42.469
but you're not the victim here.

53:44.012 --> 53:45.555
I don't think that your splinter's more…

53:46.806 --> 53:47.641
painful than

53:48.683 --> 53:50.560
a sword being stabbed
straight through the chest.

54:06.451 --> 54:09.329
Well, I'll see you after
the next soul shifter, Your Highness.

54:25.845 --> 54:27.180
What do you mean
she disappeared?

54:27.264 --> 54:28.807
Look over here, my lady.

54:30.016 --> 54:31.351
She must have used these to climb

54:31.434 --> 54:33.853
and then escaped
through the window up there.

54:34.938 --> 54:36.398
What are those doing there?

54:37.399 --> 54:39.192
How could Bu-yeon do this?

54:39.276 --> 54:40.110
I don't know.

54:42.862 --> 54:45.448
We must find her before my mother does.

54:46.116 --> 54:47.826
We've tied a tracking thread on her wrist.

54:47.909 --> 54:50.370
It may take some time, but we'll find her.

55:07.262 --> 55:09.639
The last time I got out,
it took them four hours to find me.

55:09.723 --> 55:11.474
I must find my betrothed before then.

55:12.142 --> 55:14.602
He comes from the Seo family
at Seoho Fortress.

55:15.312 --> 55:17.355
When he arrives, he'll stay
at Chwiseonru for a while.

55:17.439 --> 55:18.523
Chwiseonru.

55:22.736 --> 55:26.406
So you're looking for a man
arriving from Seoho Fortress, right?

55:26.489 --> 55:29.117
That's right.
I was told he would be staying here.

55:29.701 --> 55:31.619
Yes. We do have that name.

55:32.412 --> 55:35.415
But there are two here, so…

55:38.793 --> 55:40.420
I guess I'm looking for the one

55:40.503 --> 55:42.756
that could be a perfect suitor
in every possible way.

55:42.839 --> 55:44.799
Ah.

55:44.883 --> 55:46.843
Then you are seeking Young Master Seo Yul.

55:47.427 --> 55:48.553
Seo Yul?

55:48.636 --> 55:50.889
Seo Yul, yeah, don't you know him?

55:52.307 --> 55:54.309
So you must not come from Daeho then.

55:54.934 --> 55:57.520
There isn't a single woman
who doesn't know about him.

55:59.606 --> 56:02.275
I'm sorry but I cannot reveal
a guest information.

56:09.407 --> 56:10.950
I'd like you to tell me more about him.

56:17.707 --> 56:19.501
Go and see if this is genuine or not.

56:20.293 --> 56:21.294
Yeah.

56:23.171 --> 56:25.840
There are four men
that are from the Daeho Fortress

56:25.924 --> 56:27.634
all the women want to marry.

56:27.717 --> 56:28.551
First off.

56:29.427 --> 56:32.555
There's the Crown Prince
who will one day become the king of Daeho.

56:35.058 --> 56:36.351
Crown Prince Go Won.

56:36.935 --> 56:39.979
While he's still unwed,
he's not someone just anyone can marry.

56:41.147 --> 56:43.525
Then there is the new leader of Songrim,

56:43.608 --> 56:46.986
who's from the wealthiest family
in Daeho, Park Dang-gu.

56:48.405 --> 56:51.074
His engagement broke off
at the very last minute.

56:51.157 --> 56:53.076
But such a past is not a deal breaker.

56:53.993 --> 56:56.955
Then there is… Seo Yul.

56:58.123 --> 57:01.835
He's from the most distinguished family
and is perfect in every way.

57:01.918 --> 57:06.047
Well, I guess his only catch is that
Seoho Fortress is far from here.

57:06.798 --> 57:08.925
Finally, Jang Uk.

57:10.051 --> 57:13.555
He is probably the strongest man
in the world right now.

57:13.638 --> 57:15.890
But I wouldn't recommend him.

57:16.391 --> 57:17.225
Why not?

57:17.851 --> 57:19.602
You should never date a man whose past is

57:19.686 --> 57:22.897
as painful as a sword
being plunged into your chest.

57:25.984 --> 57:29.571
So among all of these men,
you came to meet Seo Yul, young lady?

57:30.363 --> 57:32.031
I believe he's who I'm looking for.

57:32.115 --> 57:33.700
When will he be here?

57:33.783 --> 57:37.412
The boat from Seoho Fortress
is arriving any time now. He'll be here.

57:38.746 --> 57:40.957
By the way, how do you know him?

57:42.125 --> 57:44.836
You talked about him being a suitor,
so you've decided?

57:46.713 --> 57:47.839
I don't know yet.

57:48.339 --> 57:51.593
But I'm going to make my decision
once I've met and spoken to him.

57:51.676 --> 57:53.928
Oh, well. aren't you confident?

57:55.513 --> 57:58.016
He's not someone
you can marry just on good looks.

57:58.099 --> 58:00.310
Which family are you from then?

58:02.896 --> 58:04.189
Excuse me, Madam.

58:10.570 --> 58:14.324
This is indeed authentic,
but this bears the crest of Jinyowon.

58:14.407 --> 58:16.868
She's willing to offer
something so precious?

58:17.911 --> 58:18.953
She must be a thief.

58:23.291 --> 58:24.209
My lady.

58:24.292 --> 58:26.503
What is your relationship to Jinyowon?

58:28.880 --> 58:30.006
How suspicious.

58:30.673 --> 58:33.510
I'll need to go there and see
if this really belongs to you.

58:35.261 --> 58:37.305
Stop her! Stop that thief right now!

58:40.099 --> 58:41.059
Good day, my lord.

58:41.142 --> 58:43.728
- So has Yul arrived yet?
- I think not yet, my lord.

59:04.832 --> 59:06.543
They said he'd be here soon.

59:08.253 --> 59:09.796
Probably from over there.

59:11.506 --> 59:13.341
If he's supposed
to be perfect in every way,

59:14.050 --> 59:15.426
he must be handsome too.

59:22.809 --> 59:25.144
Hi, is your last name Seo?

59:25.937 --> 59:27.480
I'm sorry but I'm not,

59:27.564 --> 59:28.898
although I'd like to know you.

59:28.982 --> 59:30.358
Never mind, just go.

59:52.630 --> 59:55.883
This boat's departing for Bisan-dong.

59:55.967 --> 59:59.095
This boat will be departing shortly
for Bisan-dong.

01:00:23.953 --> 01:00:25.538
I hope that all has been well.

01:00:27.248 --> 01:00:28.416
Young Master Seo!

01:00:38.217 --> 01:00:40.261
- Thanks for the ride!
- See you next time!

01:00:40.345 --> 01:00:41.179
See you next time!

01:00:44.766 --> 01:00:47.185
If the man I end up marrying
accepts my mother's wishes,

01:00:47.769 --> 01:00:49.687
I'll be forced to remain
locked up there forever.

01:00:52.065 --> 01:00:54.442
I absolutely must speak
with him before I get caught.

01:00:55.902 --> 01:00:56.736
What do I do?

01:01:06.412 --> 01:01:10.249
Look over there.
Is that not, uh-- That's Jang Uk!

01:01:10.333 --> 01:01:12.251
- Isn't it?
- Yeah, the one with the ice stone.

01:01:12.335 --> 01:01:14.337
Young Master Jang
from the Jang family.

01:01:28.601 --> 01:01:30.311
That man over there is called Jang Uk?

01:01:30.895 --> 01:01:31.896
Yeah.

01:01:31.979 --> 01:01:32.939
Jang Uk.

01:01:35.525 --> 01:01:36.526
The fourth one.

01:01:46.452 --> 01:01:49.956
He is probably
the strongest man in the world right now.

01:01:50.540 --> 01:01:52.375
The strongest man in the world?

01:02:21.070 --> 01:02:22.989
I heard a rumor that everyone avoids you.

01:02:24.115 --> 01:02:25.408
I guess it's true.

01:02:26.033 --> 01:02:27.243
Looks like you managed to escape.

01:02:27.994 --> 01:02:29.871
So, out for a quick trip?

01:02:31.622 --> 01:02:32.707
Thanks to you.

01:02:37.545 --> 01:02:39.213
Something smells delicious here.

01:02:44.385 --> 01:02:45.720
You think I can get one of those?

01:02:50.683 --> 01:02:52.643
Forget it. I have no money.

01:02:54.520 --> 01:02:56.397
Here's that strong liquor
you like, my lord.

01:02:58.065 --> 01:02:58.900
Excuse me.

01:03:02.069 --> 01:03:03.404
I'd also like one of those.

01:03:04.113 --> 01:03:05.072
Ah, sure.

01:03:09.035 --> 01:03:10.953
Why, thanks, Jang Uk.

01:03:13.247 --> 01:03:14.373
How do you know what my name is?

01:03:14.457 --> 01:03:18.211
I discovered it by chance
while I was looking for my suitor-to-be.

01:03:19.295 --> 01:03:20.129
Suitor?

01:03:20.213 --> 01:03:22.089
I'm supposed to be getting married soon.

01:03:22.799 --> 01:03:24.425
Jinyowon will become his home afterwards.

01:03:26.594 --> 01:03:28.387
Even ordinary priestesses have
their husbands move in?

01:03:28.471 --> 01:03:32.266
Oh, no. Only the heir of the Jin family
brings her husband to Jinyowon.

01:03:32.350 --> 01:03:34.185
Jin Cho-yeon is the heir
of the Jin family.

01:03:34.811 --> 01:03:36.896
Cho-yeon is the second daughter
of the Jin family.

01:03:38.481 --> 01:03:40.775
The future leader of Jinyowon will be me,

01:03:40.858 --> 01:03:42.026
the rightful heir.

01:03:43.277 --> 01:03:44.195
Jin Bu-yeon.

01:03:48.074 --> 01:03:50.243
What? You say you're who?

01:03:52.703 --> 01:03:54.121
She died a long time ago.

01:03:54.205 --> 01:03:57.834
I already told you that I was someone
who died a long time ago.

01:04:00.461 --> 01:04:03.005
The reason that I was locked up
in that room is because

01:04:03.089 --> 01:04:04.632
I exist when I should not.

01:04:06.968 --> 01:04:11.347
My mother wants my future husband
to move in so I can give birth to an heir.

01:04:12.390 --> 01:04:15.685
If I go through with it, I will be stuck
in that room for the rest of my life.

01:04:15.768 --> 01:04:18.312
You're telling me
that you're really Jin Bu-yeon?

01:04:18.396 --> 01:04:20.565
And that you're running away
because you don't want to be married?

01:04:22.525 --> 01:04:25.236
I'm in no position to run away.
That's why I wanted to find

01:04:25.319 --> 01:04:27.405
my future husband first,
so I can ask for help.

01:04:29.866 --> 01:04:31.826
But I just came up
with this incredible idea!

01:04:34.495 --> 01:04:37.957
I should find a husband
that suits my purpose instead.

01:04:41.043 --> 01:04:42.211
So with that being said,

01:04:43.462 --> 01:04:44.297
Jang Uk…

01:04:45.923 --> 01:04:47.800
will you marry me?

01:04:49.010 --> 01:04:49.844
What?

01:04:49.927 --> 01:04:53.180
I would like for you to become my husband.

01:05:04.817 --> 01:05:07.361
There are no mages
training in Jeongjingak anymore.

01:05:08.070 --> 01:05:08.946
Ah…

01:05:10.323 --> 01:05:11.282
Except for Jang Uk.

01:05:12.241 --> 01:05:13.242
Although he's why…

01:05:14.744 --> 01:05:15.578
everyone else left.

01:05:19.165 --> 01:05:20.458
Then I was the first mage to leave.

01:05:23.419 --> 01:05:24.837
I pretty much ran out of here…

01:05:26.505 --> 01:05:28.341
when you and Uk were struggling so much.

01:05:33.095 --> 01:05:33.930
I'm so sorry.

01:05:38.976 --> 01:05:40.144
You were struggling too.

01:05:43.689 --> 01:05:44.523
You knew the truth…

01:05:46.150 --> 01:05:47.276
about who she really was?

01:05:49.403 --> 01:05:50.696
That she was actually Naksu.

01:05:54.700 --> 01:05:55.534
I did.

01:05:56.118 --> 01:05:57.745
Because even though
Uk was the first person

01:05:57.828 --> 01:05:59.538
to recognize that she was Naksu,

01:06:01.207 --> 01:06:03.459
I was the first person
that met the real Naksu.

01:06:18.349 --> 01:06:20.935
You're asking a man you've met
only once if he'd marry you?

01:06:21.727 --> 01:06:23.104
You really are crazy.

01:06:23.187 --> 01:06:24.730
I made a mistake.
I shouldn't have helped you.

01:06:24.814 --> 01:06:27.316
- Clearly, you should still be locked up.
- I'm not losing my mind here.

01:06:27.900 --> 01:06:30.069
You're the only one
strong enough to face my mother.

01:06:30.152 --> 01:06:32.154
You and Jinyowon have bad blood, right?

01:06:32.238 --> 01:06:34.615
If I marry you,
they might just kick me out.

01:06:35.491 --> 01:06:37.034
And that's exactly what I want.

01:06:39.996 --> 01:06:42.456
I can't believe I found
the perfect prospect on my first try!

01:06:48.379 --> 01:06:50.715
And I can't believe I ran into
such a crazy potential bride

01:06:50.798 --> 01:06:51.716
who I've only met once.

01:06:52.425 --> 01:06:54.260
- You consider me as a potential bride?
- I don't.

01:06:56.053 --> 01:06:57.054
Just look me in the eye.

01:06:58.681 --> 01:07:00.182
Just look and I know you'll reconsider.

01:07:05.021 --> 01:07:07.231
Do you not want to marry me?

01:07:07.314 --> 01:07:09.150
- Why would I?
- Because…

01:07:12.653 --> 01:07:13.779
I'm a rare beauty.

01:07:17.658 --> 01:07:18.868
You're driving me crazy.

01:07:19.660 --> 01:07:20.786
There's no way you can deny

01:07:21.495 --> 01:07:24.623
that I'm so beautiful, I turn heads
just by walking down the street.

01:07:28.169 --> 01:07:30.171
I'm sure you're well aware of that.

01:07:30.254 --> 01:07:31.213
Sure, yeah, you're beautiful.

01:07:32.381 --> 01:07:35.384
Use that beauty to find
a better prospective groom out there.

01:07:37.303 --> 01:07:38.721
Enjoy the chicken when it arrives.

01:07:38.804 --> 01:07:39.805
Jang Uk.

01:07:44.060 --> 01:07:44.894
You…

01:07:45.895 --> 01:07:47.688
think that I'm a easy mark
since I listen to you.

01:07:48.731 --> 01:07:49.565
That's enough, okay?

01:07:59.075 --> 01:08:02.953
Yeah, that looks good. While you're out,
enjoy yourself before you go back home.

01:08:19.553 --> 01:08:21.388
They'll find me here soon.

01:09:05.432 --> 01:09:06.892
There's something still bothering me.

01:09:09.019 --> 01:09:11.021
Judging from how determined
they are to find you,

01:09:11.939 --> 01:09:13.858
I don't think you're just
some lousy priestess.

01:09:13.941 --> 01:09:16.777
So… you're really Jin Bu-yeon?

01:09:17.486 --> 01:09:19.864
I am. I am Jin Bu-yeon.

01:09:19.947 --> 01:09:21.323
But she went missing years ago.

01:09:21.407 --> 01:09:23.701
She was found three years ago,
and I am her.

01:09:23.784 --> 01:09:25.911
They thought that So-I was
the real daughter as well.

01:09:25.995 --> 01:09:29.456
If I were a fraud, why would they
have kept me hidden for three years?

01:09:30.291 --> 01:09:31.584
I'm really her.

01:09:32.501 --> 01:09:35.212
I mean, Jin Bu-yeon is supposed to have

01:09:36.130 --> 01:09:38.215
the ability to see energy
just like you're able to.

01:09:40.342 --> 01:09:43.429
You… saw the ice stone, didn't you?

01:09:44.138 --> 01:09:47.933
Yeah. I'm the eldest daughter
of Jinyowon with great divine powers.

01:09:48.893 --> 01:09:51.604
If my beauty doesn't sway you,
consider my ability then.

01:09:52.313 --> 01:09:54.106
You never know
when you might need my help someday.

01:09:58.360 --> 01:09:59.195
Fine then.

01:10:00.487 --> 01:10:02.239
If someday I ever need any help from you,

01:10:03.407 --> 01:10:04.366
I know where to find you.

01:10:06.160 --> 01:10:07.536
No, please!

01:10:10.164 --> 01:10:12.124
The wedding will take place
on the full moon.

01:10:12.208 --> 01:10:15.044
If I go through with it,
I'll never leave that room.

01:10:16.587 --> 01:10:18.547
To prevent that,
I need to find a different groom.

01:10:21.967 --> 01:10:24.929
I hope you'll come and take me with you.

01:10:26.430 --> 01:10:27.348
I'll be waiting.

01:10:28.432 --> 01:10:31.227
Please! Please come, okay?

01:10:43.197 --> 01:10:44.031
Jang Uk.

01:10:45.074 --> 01:10:48.369
Everyone goes out of their way
to avoid you.

01:10:49.203 --> 01:10:51.247
You should get married
to someone while they're willing to.

01:10:52.248 --> 01:10:53.916
I told you that I'm willing to marry you.

01:10:56.460 --> 01:10:57.294
No, thanks.

01:11:07.554 --> 01:11:08.889
There you are.

01:11:09.473 --> 01:11:10.766
Let's go.

01:11:21.068 --> 01:11:22.569
Have you been keeping well, my lord?

01:11:22.653 --> 01:11:24.863
Hey, I am no longer the leader.

01:11:25.739 --> 01:11:27.199
That man's the leader now.

01:11:28.075 --> 01:11:30.286
Hey… Uncle.

01:11:30.369 --> 01:11:32.663
You know how uncomfortable I feel
whenever anyone calls me that.

01:11:32.746 --> 01:11:34.665
Could you please take
your position back, my lord?

01:11:34.748 --> 01:11:36.542
Then you can let me help
as your assistant and then we can--

01:11:36.625 --> 01:11:37.668
No way!

01:11:37.751 --> 01:11:40.546
Right now, I'm more carefree
than I've been in many years.

01:11:43.465 --> 01:11:44.842
So then, what do you do these days?

01:11:44.925 --> 01:11:48.595
Well, I tend the land
and I do my own housework.

01:11:50.097 --> 01:11:50.931
Hey, Yul.

01:11:51.724 --> 01:11:56.395
I have prepared a grand feast for you
to celebrate your return to Songrim.

01:11:57.688 --> 01:12:00.399
Wait, Uncle. Did you cook this feast?

01:12:00.482 --> 01:12:02.067
Your friend should try as well.

01:12:02.901 --> 01:12:06.363
Yul, you'll like it.

01:12:15.247 --> 01:12:17.958
Yeah, he's right.
I can't be his only victim.

01:12:18.042 --> 01:12:20.044
You should try it as well, hmm.

01:12:22.838 --> 01:12:24.673
It looks like
another victim is joining us.

01:12:37.311 --> 01:12:38.145
You're back.

01:12:43.067 --> 01:12:44.526
Yeah, I'm back.

01:13:15.349 --> 01:13:18.977
I dug out the deodeok all by myself,
brushed on a little bit of gochujang,

01:13:20.229 --> 01:13:21.146
charbroiled it.

01:13:22.022 --> 01:13:23.399
Doesn't it smell great?

01:13:26.777 --> 01:13:27.986
This is deodeok, you say?

01:13:30.989 --> 01:13:32.408
I wouldn't have guessed.

01:13:33.909 --> 01:13:37.246
Yul must have
a very dull palate then, huh?

01:13:38.664 --> 01:13:40.249
You need to savor it.

01:13:45.254 --> 01:13:46.380
It has an interesting smell.

01:13:50.551 --> 01:13:52.970
I really appreciate
your generosity, my lord.

01:13:54.221 --> 01:13:56.098
But I don't think I can eat another bite.

01:13:57.558 --> 01:13:58.976
I see, sure…

01:14:00.018 --> 01:14:02.396
Seems like it's not to Yul's liking, huh?

01:14:03.105 --> 01:14:04.189
Right.

01:14:04.273 --> 01:14:07.401
Dang-gu and Uk here can have the rest.

01:14:21.248 --> 01:14:23.250
I'm delighted to have
you three sitting here

01:14:23.333 --> 01:14:26.628
- with me after such a long time.
- Mm.

01:14:27.504 --> 01:14:28.505
Cheers.

01:14:39.683 --> 01:14:41.435
- Eat up! Go on.
- Eat up now!

01:14:46.607 --> 01:14:47.608
You're saying

01:14:48.275 --> 01:14:50.569
the news of our wedding here
got to Dang-gu?

01:14:51.153 --> 01:14:52.154
Yes.

01:14:52.237 --> 01:14:54.865
I heard that he kept asking
who was getting married.

01:14:58.744 --> 01:15:00.496
Since he doesn't know about Bu-yeon,

01:15:01.079 --> 01:15:02.956
he would think it's my wedding.

01:15:10.380 --> 01:15:12.966
I loved you, Cho-yeon.

01:15:13.926 --> 01:15:17.304
You gotta be happy!

01:15:19.056 --> 01:15:20.682
Cho-yeon.

01:15:20.766 --> 01:15:24.478
No, I don't want you
to be happy without me…

01:15:24.561 --> 01:15:26.063
I'll take him back to his room
and get him to bed.

01:15:26.146 --> 01:15:26.980
All right.

01:15:27.981 --> 01:15:30.442
Bye then.

01:15:35.030 --> 01:15:36.240
Poor Dang-gu.

01:15:37.282 --> 01:15:38.784
Just look at how drunk he got.

01:15:40.035 --> 01:15:43.372
The wedding that's happening in Jinyowon
Sang-ho was talking about must be true.

01:15:47.209 --> 01:15:50.170
Jinyowon is really hosting a wedding soon?

01:15:50.754 --> 01:15:53.173
They say they've been bringing in
everything they need for the wedding.

01:15:53.966 --> 01:15:55.842
For the past three years,
they've kept their gates barred

01:15:55.926 --> 01:15:57.344
and wouldn't let anyone in.

01:15:57.928 --> 01:15:59.513
I suppose they are trying
to hold the wedding

01:15:59.596 --> 01:16:01.181
with as little attention as it can get.

01:16:04.851 --> 01:16:06.937
Do you know
who in the Jin family is getting married?

01:16:07.020 --> 01:16:08.272
Jin Cho-yeon, probably.

01:16:09.356 --> 01:16:12.276
She's that family's only daughter,
after all.

01:16:13.777 --> 01:16:15.445
Isn't Jin Bu-yeon
the eldest daughter though?

01:16:15.529 --> 01:16:17.114
But Jin Bu-yeon is dead.

01:16:17.656 --> 01:16:21.034
She died while retrieving the ice stone
that was sealed in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho

01:16:21.743 --> 01:16:23.328
when its waters swept her away.

01:16:23.412 --> 01:16:24.580
Her father confessed to us…

01:16:26.039 --> 01:16:27.749
about what really happened before he died.

01:16:29.418 --> 01:16:31.837
Her death… what a shame.

01:16:32.421 --> 01:16:35.215
She showed such promise
of divine powers at such a young age.

01:16:36.383 --> 01:16:38.093
I can only imagine
that she would've grown up

01:16:38.176 --> 01:16:41.096
to be as powerful as Jin Seol-ran,
Jinyowon's first leader.

01:16:43.849 --> 01:16:44.683
If there's…

01:16:46.184 --> 01:16:47.978
a priestess as powerful as Jin Seol-ran,

01:16:49.980 --> 01:16:52.482
will she be able
to extract the ice stone from within me?

01:16:53.483 --> 01:16:54.693
Even if she were able,

01:16:55.736 --> 01:16:56.987
do you want to have it removed?

01:17:03.243 --> 01:17:06.913
Right now, the only reason you're alive
is thanks to that stone's power.

01:17:07.497 --> 01:17:08.498
But you told me

01:17:09.333 --> 01:17:12.127
it had to be destroyed
because no human can handle its power.

01:17:13.629 --> 01:17:14.463
Yes.

01:17:15.505 --> 01:17:16.673
You were absolutely right.

01:17:18.175 --> 01:17:19.259
It's become too much…

01:17:21.428 --> 01:17:22.262
for me to handle.

01:17:27.851 --> 01:17:29.227
Maidservant Kim had told me…

01:17:30.812 --> 01:17:33.815
even looking at you brings her pain
as it seems like you still have

01:17:33.899 --> 01:17:36.026
a sword buried deep
within that chest of yours.

01:17:37.653 --> 01:17:38.987
Do you still feel its pain?

01:17:41.531 --> 01:17:42.908
I should have just died back then.

01:17:43.533 --> 01:17:45.243
Dying right then and there is the most…

01:17:46.578 --> 01:17:48.747
that any real human is
ever able to handle.

01:17:49.331 --> 01:17:51.166
Do you really think that
removing the ice stone…

01:17:52.542 --> 01:17:55.337
would also remove the sword that's still
buried deep within your chest?

01:18:01.510 --> 01:18:04.388
But if you… if you try and remove it,

01:18:06.014 --> 01:18:06.932
you will die.

01:18:10.811 --> 01:18:11.645
At least then…

01:18:14.856 --> 01:18:17.734
I will be lifting the weight
that's right on my shoulders.

01:19:26.803 --> 01:19:29.055
Uncle Yun-o,
so you're here to get married?

01:19:30.182 --> 01:19:31.850
But you never told me anything about that.

01:19:33.018 --> 01:19:36.104
It was meant to remain a secret,
so I couldn't say anything.

01:19:37.481 --> 01:19:39.983
Well, so tonight,
Jinyowon's eldest daughter,

01:19:40.066 --> 01:19:41.526
Jin Bu-yeon, will be my bride.

01:19:49.409 --> 01:19:52.287
It's our tradition for the bride
to get married at the groom's home,

01:19:53.038 --> 01:19:55.081
and then the two of you will come here.

01:20:03.965 --> 01:20:04.883
What is that?

01:20:05.967 --> 01:20:07.302
A petal?

01:20:08.220 --> 01:20:10.263
It came to me
when I was at my most desperate.

01:20:12.891 --> 01:20:14.392
I hope it will come back to me soon.

01:20:17.270 --> 01:20:21.066
No matter what,
you cannot think about running away.

01:20:22.984 --> 01:20:23.819
I know.

01:20:24.778 --> 01:20:25.779
I'll just keep waiting.

01:20:26.446 --> 01:20:28.865
Waiting? For who?

01:20:31.368 --> 01:20:32.494
For my husband.

01:20:35.539 --> 01:20:38.500
Please come and take me with you.

01:21:05.694 --> 01:21:07.696
The bride must have left Jinyowon.

01:21:08.405 --> 01:21:09.489
She will be here soon.

01:21:11.992 --> 01:21:14.870
Is he the one
Bu-yeon will get married to tonight?

01:21:14.953 --> 01:21:15.787
Yes.

01:21:16.288 --> 01:21:19.583
He's the younger cousin of General Seo
as well as the Queen of Daeho.

01:21:20.166 --> 01:21:23.336
He lost both of his parents
so he has no one to rely on at all.

01:21:24.671 --> 01:21:26.840
Jinyowon's strength is
something that he needs,

01:21:27.424 --> 01:21:29.759
so he'll do perfect for us.

01:21:34.055 --> 01:21:35.056
That person there

01:21:35.765 --> 01:21:38.435
will never be able
to free my sister from this place.

01:21:55.744 --> 01:21:57.120
Guess he's not coming.

01:23:34.551 --> 01:23:35.385
I knew it.

01:23:36.219 --> 01:23:37.429
I knew you'd come for me.

01:23:38.596 --> 01:23:40.015
I thought I might need your help.

01:23:40.598 --> 01:23:42.225
I told you I'd be useful to you.

01:23:49.065 --> 01:23:50.316
Come on.

01:23:50.400 --> 01:23:51.234
All right.

01:23:55.989 --> 01:23:57.991
Let's go now, my husband.

01:25:04.432 --> 01:25:07.352
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:25:08.144 --> 01:25:10.313
I have no memories at all before Jinyowon.

01:25:11.189 --> 01:25:13.316
Search this place thoroughly
for Park Dang-gu at once.

01:25:13.399 --> 01:25:15.610
But I thought that it was
Young Lady Cho-yeon's wedding.

01:25:15.693 --> 01:25:17.654
And I did want to run over
and ruin the ceremony, 

01:25:17.737 --> 01:25:19.239
but I didn't do that.

01:25:19.322 --> 01:25:20.156
WHOEVER FINDS THIS LADY
WILL BE REWARDED GENEROUSLY

01:25:20.240 --> 01:25:22.867
Bu-yeon's existence has finally
been revealed to the whole world.

01:25:23.409 --> 01:25:25.954
That rare beauty
could take out the ice stone for you?

01:25:27.163 --> 01:25:30.041
I was just wondering if,
by any chance, we've met before?

01:25:31.000 --> 01:25:33.795
So what is it then
that you want from me?

01:25:34.295 --> 01:25:37.382
As long as you still have
your powers, that is what I need from you.
